{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0f1e88d9415ec6b2d0616a43280d7272405aa1f7576f16e94b28cb3d9693e390","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"xingyaoww/code-act@d607f56c9cfe snapshot f7a43317eb47f954","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7db9ead4cf1f04b9ac3d9185e55e40da76f943a8021a11e7d649bfeab5591765","slc_beafb20c018e99bd75124374b806594669c722a056392b2d7747cec7ed4534ea","slc_c0caa0569c9ab73a54553766d00a91a57eead423ba53a2f1e6e1935d03a22416"],"source_ids":["src_4217d20861fd5d6f9d601c3900f19bde"],"text":"Repository development practice: training data is converted to Megatron format with ChatML chat templating and sequence packing (e.g., 78k instances packed into 19k sequences), and checkpoints can be converted back to HuggingFace format with a ChatML chat_template added.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1bf43c288d3cc85b46c2e7c13a964952699f9ca39ef535c1e80f2281a9902a1e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"xingyaoww/code-act@d607f56c9cfe snapshot f7a43317eb47f954","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c2fbae03a244b369adcbf2e613c662a347edc0f21b7eb2e682537b1e1d7797e","slc_e81c7adc3ce01459f4b0b2eb66a211b8602d382ff6e52b8ab5f55f0f278d0a66"],"source_ids":["src_6b7d389a12af5f2fb73c2d3e02801a70"],"text":"Two agent variants are released: CodeActAgent-Mistral-7b-v0.1 (recommended, Mistral-7b-v0.1 base with a 32k context window) and CodeActAgent-Llama-7b (Llama-2-7b base with a 4k context window), trained on the 7k multi-turn CodeActInstruct dataset.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_20861860fad0c266f19753fb21eba6da67fc23bf6f95c6ecc6df048cc3e6b750","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"xingyaoww/code-act@d607f56c9cfe snapshot f7a43317eb47f954","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_782469b32f30e0471059c7c11fe53418bce274a13ba557a52b7001950baa10e0"],"source_ids":["src_6b7d389a12af5f2fb73c2d3e02801a70"],"text":"A CodeActAgent system comprises an LLM serving layer (e.g., vLLM exposing an OpenAI-compatible API), an interaction interface (chat-ui with MongoDB history or a simple Python script), and a code execution engine service.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3491975c3f530622f979c934f4e9d964cbef512a3a7389751f3896868e66ffcf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"xingyaoww/code-act@d607f56c9cfe snapshot f7a43317eb47f954","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_471e04837d85429d55ea06e7b6274a2f89b119836c7eeea35acfa790e86a1382","slc_ba9efce1fd403e2db1fbd457a9050279d19aa8a866ba677c5f44871a734af7b9"],"source_ids":["src_6b7d389a12af5f2fb73c2d3e02801a70"],"text":"The code execution engine exposes an HTTP endpoint (example port 8081 via start_jupyter_server.sh) that the demo Python script consumes through a jupyter_kernel_url /execute path.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6cbb7b7948fd85ddcd4b6c2fd6f6ce818de2b3880fa7cfe0d1713ef7dc8e2060","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"xingyaoww/code-act@d607f56c9cfe snapshot f7a43317eb47f954","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8d894dba73799d0b9f2d6f1cdb9346b596abf03bbed136f47a1de2076b8c1a58"],"source_ids":["src_6b7d389a12af5f2fb73c2d3e02801a70"],"text":"CodeAct consolidates LLM agent actions into a unified action space using executable code, integrated with a Python interpreter so the agent can revise prior actions or emit new ones based on execution results across multi-turn interactions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","created_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_be833915e75abae8de582004c37af8fd9ea67b53e6648bd8f0ad8460d02a7756","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"xingyaoww/code-act@d607f56c9cfe snapshot f7a43317eb47f954","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_334e739bcb886070124539480f62bd5556cb92175a6e21c694b5bee336d80814"],"source_ids":["src_6b7d389a12af5f2fb73c2d3e02801a70"],"text":"The code execution engine is built on JupyterKernelGateway and starts a Jupyter server inside a Docker container per chat session to serve code execution requests, with sessions timing out after a fixed period.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:59:21Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b"}
